    "title": "KEB seeking community ideas for murals - NewsBreak",
    "text": "thecrossroads.news\nwebsite\nEmanuel County, Georgia\nKEB seeking community ideas for murals\nBy thecrossroadsnews,\n19 hours agoKeep Emanuel Beautiful is gathering ideas for a new mural initiative in Emanuel County. If you have suggestions for locations, themes, or would like to offer a wall or your artistic talents, your input is welcome. No decisions have been made; this is just the first step to explore what’s possible. KEB is already in contact with the local art guild about possible partnerships and artist involvement. However, the board of directors still wants to hear from the public.",
